456` | :math:`-0.544` |\n42\t * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n43\t * | :math:`-2.456` | :math:`-2.0`   | :math:`-0.456` | :math:`-0.456` |\n44\t * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n45\t * | :math:`-3.456` | :math:`-2.0`   | :math:`-1.456` | :math:`+0.544` |\n46\t * +----------------+----------------+----------------+----------------+\n47\t *\n48\t * Mathematical Function\n49\t * =====================\n50\t *\n51\t * .. math::\n52\t *\n53\t *    fmod(x, y) = x - n \\cdot y \\wedge n \\in \\mathbb{Z} \\wedge |fmod(x, y)| < |y| \\wedge \\frac{f(x, y)}{|f(x, y)|} = \\frac{x}{|x|}\n54\t *\n55\t * Returns\n56\t * =======\n57\t *\n58\t * ``fmod`` returns the floating-point remainder of :math:`x` divided by :math:`y`.\n59\t *\n60\t * Exceptions\n61\t * ==========\n62\t *\n63\t * Raise ``invalid operation`` exception when :math:`x` is infinite or\n64\t * :math:`y` is zero.\n65\t *\n66\t * .. May raise ``underflow`` exception.\n67\t *\n68\t * Output map\n69\t * ==========\n70\t *\n71\t * +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+\n72\t * | fmod(x,y)                | x                                                                                                                                                                                          |\n73\t * +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+\n74\t * | y                        | :math:`-Inf`             | :math:`<0`               | :math:`-0`               | :math:`+0`               | :math:`>0`               | :math:`+Inf`             | :math:`NaN`              |\n75\t * +==========================+==========================+==========================+==========================+==========================+==========================+==========================+==========================+\n76\t * | :math:`-Inf`             | :math:`qNaN`             | :math:`x`                                                                                                 | :math:`qNaN`             | :math:`qNaN`             |\n77\t * +--------------------------+                          +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+                          +                          +\n78\t * | :math:`<0`               |                          | :math:`fmod(x, y)`       | :math:`x`                                           | :math:`fmod(x, y)`       |                          |                          |\n79\t * +--------------------------+                          +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+                          +                          +\n80\t * | :math:`-0`               |                          | :math:`qNaN`                                                                                              |                          |                          |\n81\t * +--------------------------+                          +                                                                                                           +                          +                          +\n82\t * | :math:`+0`               |                          |                                                                                                           |                          |                          |\n83\t * +--------------------------+                          +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+                          +                          +\n84\t * | :math:`>0`               |                          | :math:`fmod(x, y)`       | :math:`x`                                           | :math:`fmod(x, y)`       |                          |                          |\n85\t * +--------------------------+                          +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+                          +                          +\n86\t * | :math:`+Inf`             |                          | :math:`x`                                                                                                 |                          |                          |\n87\t * +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+                          +\n88\t * | :math:`NaN`              | :math:`qNaN`                                                                                                                                                    |                          |\n89\t * +--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+--------------------------+\n90\t *\n91\t */\n92\t\n93\t#include <math.h>\n94\t#include \"../common/tools.h\"\n95\t\n96\t#ifndef __LIBMCS_DOUBLE_IS_32BITS\n97\t\n98\tstatic const double Zero[] = {0.0, -0.0,};\n99\t\n100\tdouble fmod(double x, double y)\n101\t{\n102\t#ifdef __LIBMCS_FPU_DAZ\n103\t    x *= __volatile_one;\n104\t    y *= __volatile_one;\n105\t#endif /* defined(__LIBMCS_FPU_DAZ) */\n106\t\n107\t    int32_t n, hx, hy, hz, ix, iy, sx, i;\n108\t    uint32_t lx, ly, lz;\n109\t\n110\t    EXTRACT_WORDS(hx, lx, x);\n111\t    EXTRACT_WORDS(hy, ly, y);\n112\t    sx = hx & 0x80000000U;     /* sign of x */\n113\t    hx ^= sx;                  /* |x| */\n114\t  